eka dahulu mendiami", "ur": "وہ آباد رہے تھے", "bn": "তারা বসবাস করেছিল", "fa": "سکونت داشته بودند"}}, {"text": "فِيهَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بُعْدًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِّمَدْيَنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَعِدَتْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ثَمُودُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَغْنَوْا۟", "count": 3, "first": "7:92", "audio": "audio/0caf360e5dba23649d62.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}], "gloss": {"bs": "boravili su", "en": "they had dwelt", "tr": "yaşamışlardı", "fr": "ils ont séjourné", "id": "mereka telah tinggal", "ur": "وہ رہے تھے", "bn": "তারা অবস্থান করেছিল", "fa": "سکونت داشتند"}}, {"arabic": "تَغْنَ", "count": 1, "first": "10:24", "audio": "audio/586a569b7c49de64d0e1.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}]}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0558.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0558.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0558.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0558.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0558.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "يَغْنَى التَّاجِرُ بِتِجَارَتِهِ", "spoken": "audio/fce3d65c281d6e6631eb.m4a", "tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Trgovac se bogati svojim poslom.", "en": "The merchant becomes rich through his business.", "bn": "ব্যবসায়ী তার ব্যবসা দিয়ে ধনী হয়।", "fa": "بازرگان با تجارتش ثروتمند می‌شود.", "fr": "Le commerçant s'enrichit par son commerce.", "id": "Pedagang itu menjadi kaya dengan usahanya.", "tr": "Tüccar işiyle zengin olur.", "ur": "تاجر اپنے کاروبار سے مالدار ہوتا ہے۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "يَغْنَى", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "bogati se", "en": "becomes rich", "bn": "ধনী হয়", "fa": "ثروتمند می‌شود", "fr": "s'enrichit", "id": "dia menjadi kaya", "tr": "zengin olur", "ur": "مالدار ہوتا ہے"}}, {"arabic": "التَّاجِرُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "trgovac", "en": "the merchant", "bn": "ব্যবসায়ী", "fa": "بازرگان", "fr": "le commerçant", "id": "pedagang itu", "tr": "tüccar", "ur": "تاجر"}}, {"arabic": "بِتِجَارَتِهِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "svojim poslom", "en": "by his business", "bn": "তার ব্যবসা দিয়ে", "fa": "با تجارتش", "fr": "par son commerce", "id": "dengan usahanya", "tr": "işiyle", "ur": "اپنے کاروبار سے"}}]}, {"arabic": "أَغْنَى بِعَمَلِي", "spoken": "audio/cd79e8db4997ba9e22f0.m4a", "tense": "present", "pronoun": "ana", "translation": {"bs": "Bogatim se svojim radom.", "en": "I become rich through my work.", "bn": "আমি আমার কাজের মাধ্যমে ধনী হই।", "fa": "با کارم ثروتمند می‌شوم.", "fr": "Je m'enrichis par mon travail.", "id": "Aku menjadi kaya dengan pekerjaanku.", "tr": "Çalışmamla zengin olurum.", "ur": "میں اپنے کام سے مالدار ہوتا ہوں۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "أَغْنَى", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "bogatim se", "en": "become rich", "bn": "ধনী হই", "fa": "ثروتمند می‌شوم", "fr": "je m'enrichis", "id": "aku menjadi kaya", "tr": "zengin olurum", "ur": "مالدار ہوتا ہوں"}}, {"arabic": "بِعَمَلِي", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "svojim radom", "en": "through my work", "bn": "আমার কাজ দিয়ে", "fa": "با کارم", "fr": "par mon travail", "id": "dengan pekerjaanku", "tr": "çalışmamla", "ur": "اپنے کام سے"}}]}, {"arabic": "غَنُوا بَعْدَ فَقْرٍ", "spoken": "audio/d465eced713ae8a3e5de.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "translation": {"bs": "Obogatili su se nakon siromaštva.", "en": "They became rich after poverty.", "bn": "দারিদ্র্যের পর তারা ধনী হয়েছে।", "fa": "پس از فقر ثروتمند شدند.", "fr": "Ils se sont enrichis après la pauvreté.", "id": "Mereka menjadi kaya setelah kemiskinan.", "tr": "Yoksulluktan sonra zengin oldular.", "ur": "وہ غربت کے بعد مالدار ہو گئے۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "غَنُوا", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "obogatili su se", "en": "became rich", "bn": "ধনী হয়েছে", "fa": "ثروتمند شدند", "fr": "se sont enrichis", "id": "mereka menjadi kaya", "tr": "zengin oldular", "ur": "مالدار ہوئے"}}, {"arabic": "بَعْدَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "nakon", "en": "after", "bn": "পরে", "fa": "بعد از", "fr": "après", "id": "setelah", "tr": "sonra", "ur": "کے بعد"}}, {"arabic": "فَقْرٍ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "siromaštva", "en": "poverty", "bn": "দারিদ্র্য", "fa": "فقر", "fr": "de la pauvreté", "id": "kemiskinan", "tr": "yoksulluk", "ur": "غربت"}}]}, {"arabic": "اِغْنَ بِالْقَنَاعَةِ", "spoken": "audio/85d50d4e00e8741a82be.m4a", "tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "translation": {"bs": "Budi bogat zadovoljstvom.", "en": "Be rich through contentment.", "bn": "সন্তুষ্টি নিয়ে ধনী হও।", "fa": "با قناعت ثروتمند شو.", "fr": "Sois riche par le contentement.", "id": "Jadilah kaya dengan rasa puas.", "tr": "Kanaatle zengin ol.", "ur": "قناعت سے مالدار ہو جاؤ۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "اِغْنَ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "budi bogat", "en": "be rich", "bn": "ধনী হও", "fa": "ثروتمند شو", "fr": "sois riche", "id": "jadilah kaya", "tr": "zengin ol", "ur": "مالدار ہو جاؤ"}}, {"arabic": "بِالْقَنَاعَةِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "zadovoljstvom", "en": "with satisfaction", "bn": "সন্তুষ্টির সাথে", "fa": "با قناعت", "fr": "avec satisfaction", "id": "dengan kepuasan", "tr": "kanaatle", "ur": "قناعت کے ساتھ"}}]}]}